WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:17.934
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.545 --> 00:47.547
[soft music playing]

00:54.387 --> 00:55.305
[Bu-yeon] I spent

00:55.972 --> 00:58.391
far more time alone on this tree.

00:59.642 --> 01:04.147
So why did I hope
that someone… would come for me?

01:05.231 --> 01:06.649
[Jang Uk] Because we made a promise.

01:07.567 --> 01:09.194
You may not have remembered me,

01:10.070 --> 01:12.155
but you remembered
our promise to be together,

01:12.947 --> 01:14.157
and waited for me.

01:36.554 --> 01:38.598
Last time I asked you
to carry me, you just left.

01:46.439 --> 01:47.273
There.

01:47.982 --> 01:48.983
Happy?

01:49.067 --> 01:50.276
[Bu-yeon chuckles]

01:52.487 --> 01:55.406
[Bu-yeon] If this is the brief moment
our promise is allowed to come true,

01:56.074 --> 01:58.660
then let us spend time together
like any other couple

01:59.327 --> 02:01.955
who have met
after having missed each other so.

02:07.710 --> 02:08.545
[gasps]

02:09.379 --> 02:11.297
The chestnuts have already ripened.

02:17.554 --> 02:19.389
- They have.
- Shall we cook these?

02:20.181 --> 02:21.141
Sure, let's.

02:23.810 --> 02:26.688
Do you remember that you were throwing
things at me the last time I cooked?

02:28.273 --> 02:29.816
- I did?
- "I did"?

02:30.650 --> 02:32.235
You threw a knife at me.

02:32.944 --> 02:34.320
- Like this?
- Hey, stop!

02:34.404 --> 02:35.655
I bet I threw it like this.

02:36.156 --> 02:37.407
[laughs]

02:38.366 --> 02:40.493
[soft music playing]

02:51.254 --> 02:54.090
[Jang Uk] All right. I'll pretend
as if this is nothing more than just

02:54.173 --> 02:55.800
another ordinary day together,

02:56.426 --> 02:58.595
that I do not have to
especially treasure or cherish,

02:59.220 --> 03:02.056
and stay by your side
until this moment ends.

03:05.935 --> 03:07.478
We should make chestnut rice together

03:08.354 --> 03:10.398
since both you and Master Lee like it.

03:13.735 --> 03:14.652
Master Lee?

03:16.487 --> 03:18.072
Master Lee is currently at his place.

03:18.740 --> 03:21.075
He's the one
who had brought me in the first place.

03:26.414 --> 03:28.416
[pensive music playing]

03:36.841 --> 03:39.427
So I guess the Unanimous Assembly
asked you

03:39.510 --> 03:40.428
to take the ice stone out of him?

03:40.511 --> 03:42.055
I told them that I couldn't,

03:42.931 --> 03:46.434
because there is another soul shifter
that he hasn't caught yet.

03:48.519 --> 03:50.813
I see that you have decided
to let him catch you.

03:54.776 --> 03:57.278
Then go to Danhyanggok.

03:58.238 --> 04:00.949
I'm also responsible
for how things turned out for you two,

04:01.950 --> 04:04.494
so I can't sit back
and do nothing like I did before.

04:04.577 --> 04:05.411
It's time…

04:06.329 --> 04:07.830
that I do my part as well.

04:11.209 --> 04:14.087
[Jang Uk] What is it
that you have to do with us?

04:16.089 --> 04:19.425
I let you two be alone when
you two were young master and servant.

04:19.509 --> 04:22.762
I feigned ignorance even when I knew
you were master and pupil.

04:23.846 --> 04:26.933
However, I cannot just stand by and watch

04:27.016 --> 04:28.601
when you've become the hunter and hunted.

04:29.185 --> 04:31.771
So I wish to put an end
to your relationship.

04:33.815 --> 04:35.233
You saved my life, Master Lee,

04:35.858 --> 04:37.986
so I'll accept
whatever you end up deciding.

04:38.069 --> 04:40.905
Uk, will you do the same as well?

04:41.948 --> 04:43.241
[sighs]

04:50.373 --> 04:51.582
Then I want you to…

04:57.422 --> 04:58.506
have a wedding ceremony.

05:00.550 --> 05:02.302
I shall be your witness so I want…

05:03.136 --> 05:04.595
you two officially be married.

05:05.388 --> 05:06.472
[Jang Uk exhales in relief]

05:10.935 --> 05:11.978
[Master Lee inhales deeply]

05:12.603 --> 05:13.479
Let's go get ready then.

05:14.314 --> 05:16.858
The weather is nice,
so let's do it right now.

05:16.941 --> 05:17.942
Okay.

05:18.026 --> 05:19.235
[chuckles]

05:19.319 --> 05:21.321
[soft music playing]

05:31.622 --> 05:32.498
Hey, you two.

05:33.750 --> 05:34.876
What's going on here now?

05:35.585 --> 05:37.462
I see. You wish to be my pupils?

05:38.212 --> 05:41.299
Will you drink chaste tea
and cut off your libido?

05:41.382 --> 05:42.800
- Uh, no.
- Oh, no way.

05:43.593 --> 05:44.594
Well, if it's a wedding,

05:45.178 --> 05:46.596
you two should be facing each other.

05:46.679 --> 05:48.556
Oh! Oh.

05:51.059 --> 05:52.477
[Master Lee] A wedding ceremony

05:52.560 --> 05:55.688
is how you announce your marriage
to the people around you.

05:56.314 --> 05:58.191
But it's also to inform the skies.

05:58.775 --> 06:02.737
It's telling them,
"We have decided to be together forever."

06:02.820 --> 06:05.198
"Therefore, no one can tear us apart."

06:07.533 --> 06:09.619
Now, Jang Uk of the Jang family and…

06:14.665 --> 06:17.418
Come to think of it,
you have four different names.

06:18.336 --> 06:22.340
You were born Cho Yeong,
but then, later, you became Naksu.

06:22.423 --> 06:23.758
Then you lived as Mu-deok,

06:25.301 --> 06:26.677
and now you are Jin Bu-yeon.

06:28.679 --> 06:29.889
I wasn't able to…

06:30.890 --> 06:32.725
live my life with just one name.

06:33.726 --> 06:35.186
[Master Lee] Which should I call you?

06:37.647 --> 06:39.982
The name that my parents first gave to me.

06:43.111 --> 06:44.612
Please call me Cho Yeong.

06:49.408 --> 06:50.576
[Master Lee] Uk and Yeong.

06:51.828 --> 06:53.121
Your name means "light."

06:53.746 --> 06:55.206
Your name means "shadow."

06:55.748 --> 06:57.583
You are light and shadow.

06:59.877 --> 07:00.920
I suppose you may…

07:02.213 --> 07:04.048
have been destined for each other.

07:05.049 --> 07:10.138
Now, let's begin the wedding ceremony
of Jang Uk and Cho Yeong.

07:11.180 --> 07:13.599
[gentle music playing]

07:22.483 --> 07:23.401
The wedding drink.

07:35.872 --> 07:39.667
If you drink that, it means
we're officially married, all right?

07:41.127 --> 07:42.837
Uk. Drink up.

07:48.384 --> 07:50.428
[Jang Uk] If you can,
I'll take you with me.

07:50.511 --> 07:52.096
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

07:52.847 --> 07:54.265
[Bu-yeon] For a very long time now,

07:55.600 --> 07:56.893
you and I have liked each other.

08:01.063 --> 08:04.734
I'm always going to stay
by your side at this distance.

08:06.402 --> 08:07.612
That's a promise.

08:11.115 --> 08:12.116
[Jang Uk] I must have…

08:13.159 --> 08:14.368
gone crazy because of you.

08:15.745 --> 08:17.622
I've found yet another use
that you have for me.

08:18.206 --> 08:21.334
Since you're offering
to be her real-life substitute.

08:24.295 --> 08:25.963
[Bu-yeon] Regardless, this hand is mine.

08:26.839 --> 08:30.176
If I hold you or rock you to sleep,
that's me, all right!

08:33.095 --> 08:36.557
So when you're looking at me like this,
see me for who I am.

08:40.019 --> 08:41.312
How pretty!

08:42.939 --> 08:44.440
[Jang Uk] You told me to see you
for who you are.

08:45.149 --> 08:46.692
That is what I'm trying to do right now.

08:47.318 --> 08:48.319
[Bu-yeon] Then I am…

08:49.529 --> 08:53.115
also going to brag to everybody
that you called the lights for me

08:53.616 --> 08:54.659
when it was dark.

08:55.618 --> 08:57.578
Sure, go ahead and tell them.

09:01.791 --> 09:04.293
[Bu-yeon] I plan to find my own room.

09:05.336 --> 09:08.839
I will try my best to find out
who I really am and decorate it well.

09:10.883 --> 09:11.801
So that…

09:12.718 --> 09:14.095
you don't get confused anymore.

09:15.846 --> 09:19.308
I will make it
a warm, comfortable place for you.

09:20.685 --> 09:21.769
[Jang Uk] I want to see you.

09:22.812 --> 09:24.188
That's why I came all this way.

09:25.815 --> 09:27.817
["Breath" by Kim Na Young
continues playing]

09:32.530 --> 09:34.198
[Bu-yeon] I liked you even from the start.

09:37.201 --> 09:38.369
I knew when I saw you.

09:39.537 --> 09:40.413
You're my husband.

09:43.541 --> 09:46.168
I now pronounce you husband and wife.

09:47.753 --> 09:50.006
You've informed the skies
with this ceremony,

09:50.089 --> 09:52.925
and I wish you a long life together.

09:56.304 --> 09:58.180
Of all the couples I've married,

10:00.266 --> 10:01.851
you two are the most beautiful.

10:03.811 --> 10:06.522
["Breath" continues playing]

10:22.538 --> 10:23.497
[Jang Uk] I promised you

10:24.707 --> 10:26.584
that I would bring you
all the way up here.

10:26.667 --> 10:28.753
You were right. You can see everything.

10:30.671 --> 10:31.714
It's nice.

10:38.763 --> 10:40.389
Looking at you like this…

10:42.642 --> 10:44.727
it feels like
I've known you for some time,

10:45.436 --> 10:47.063
but it's like we've just met too.

10:51.233 --> 10:52.401
It feels a bit strange.

11:03.954 --> 11:06.666
It feels like I've held your hand
a long time ago.

11:08.709 --> 11:10.878
But it also feels like
I've just held it too.

11:16.634 --> 11:18.219
Everything is clear for me now.

11:18.302 --> 11:19.512
I've seen you…

11:21.263 --> 11:22.932
for who you are from the start, just like…

11:25.393 --> 11:27.061
how I recognized you the first time.

11:29.188 --> 11:30.773
The girl with blue marks in…

11:35.945 --> 11:36.779
her eyes.

11:48.040 --> 11:50.042
["Breath" by Kim Na Young ends]

11:54.380 --> 11:58.008
Do you think Bu-yeon is with Jang Uk?

11:59.718 --> 12:03.764
Jang Uk will have gone to find her
because of what she said earlier.

12:03.848 --> 12:06.058
Why did you not stop her then?

12:06.142 --> 12:07.852
Jang Uk got rid of Jin Mu,

12:08.853 --> 12:10.396
and she found the Jinyowon Plaque.

12:11.647 --> 12:12.982
In any case, those two…

12:14.108 --> 12:15.985
helped to keep Jinyowon from harm.

12:18.571 --> 12:22.366
I'd like to think that
she is looking out for both of them.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.617
What do you mean?

12:24.785 --> 12:27.746
You know, I asked them
how they first came to meet each other.

12:27.830 --> 12:31.375
They said they met
because this door was open.

12:31.459 --> 12:33.043
So do you really believe

12:33.544 --> 12:36.255
that her soul remained here
along with the ice stone

12:36.338 --> 12:38.007
and was reborn as my daughter?

12:38.924 --> 12:40.342
How is that even possible?

12:40.426 --> 12:43.971
My existence is sure proof
that it's indeed very possible.

12:44.054 --> 12:46.599
[soft dramatic music]

12:48.058 --> 12:50.644
I mean, I'm alive in the body
of a young boy who had died.

12:54.523 --> 12:56.025
She may have done the same as me.

12:56.108 --> 12:59.111
Let's say you are correct
and that it's possible.

12:59.862 --> 13:03.991
Then what's the real reason
she chose to stay instead of passing on?

13:04.074 --> 13:05.576
There must be a clear reason

13:06.327 --> 13:10.331
why she decided to stay with the ice stone
instead passing 200 years ago.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.460
Sounds like you do know as to why.

13:15.544 --> 13:17.004
If she did protect the ice stone,

13:17.505 --> 13:20.007
then that would mean
the power may soon be used again.

13:22.468 --> 13:26.931
I fear that the Great Chaos
Jin Seol-ran and my master, Seo Gyeong,

13:27.014 --> 13:32.061
had gone through long ago
may finally be coming for us yet again.

13:34.021 --> 13:35.356
The fire bird is safe.

13:37.525 --> 13:38.901
Jin Mu is really dead.

13:40.569 --> 13:42.863
[ominous music playing]

14:02.341 --> 14:03.425
[music fades]

14:07.012 --> 14:07.930
[Master Lee] Hmm.

14:08.013 --> 14:08.889
[lid clatters]

14:09.598 --> 14:10.474
[lid clanks]

14:12.351 --> 14:15.020
Heo Yeom stocked this place
with food and firewood

14:15.104 --> 14:16.730
for when I'd come back here.

14:17.898 --> 14:20.025
It should definitely last you
at least a month.

14:20.609 --> 14:21.443
Only a month?

14:21.527 --> 14:23.654
Why? Is that too short?

14:24.947 --> 14:26.115
[smacks lips]

14:26.198 --> 14:28.576
I didn't expect it to be long anyway.

14:28.659 --> 14:32.371
I only came here
to be with her until the very end.

14:32.454 --> 14:33.789
I didn't know if that it would be…

14:34.832 --> 14:38.127
two weeks or even only just
a few more days from now.

14:40.546 --> 14:42.047
But I don't want to keep count anymore.

14:43.549 --> 14:44.842
I'll just spend our day…

14:45.926 --> 14:47.386
living like tomorrow won't come.

14:48.470 --> 14:51.849
How many of her memories
have already come back to her?

14:53.976 --> 14:54.810
There's still…

14:56.186 --> 14:57.980
a memory she's not able to recall.

14:59.231 --> 15:00.733
[Bu-yeon] You said you wanted to know

15:01.525 --> 15:03.652
how I felt in our last moment together.

15:03.736 --> 15:05.988
[somber music playing]

15:08.574 --> 15:09.617
That moment will be

15:10.492 --> 15:12.411
probably the last memory that I recover.

15:19.835 --> 15:21.420
When I recall that last memory,

15:24.924 --> 15:26.425
I'll give you a sign like this.

15:28.969 --> 15:31.847
Then I will tell you what I remember.

15:35.768 --> 15:36.810
It's going to be the…

15:40.522 --> 15:42.066
last love letter I write to you.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.448
[Jang Uk] In the past,
I couldn't understand

15:49.990 --> 15:52.201
why Master Seo Gyeong wrote a love letter

15:52.826 --> 15:54.453
but didn't end up sending it.

15:54.536 --> 15:58.958
But now, I understand what he felt like
in not being able to send it.

15:59.458 --> 16:01.919
That love letter was written
for Jin Seol-ran.

16:03.754 --> 16:08.050
My only hope is that
you'll get a chance to express your love.

16:12.262 --> 16:14.181
Heo Yeom also got me new bedding.

16:14.264 --> 16:16.725
That should be here somewhere.
Uh, maybe it's in the storage.

16:18.310 --> 16:20.187
[door opens, closes]

16:20.270 --> 16:21.313
Jin Seol-ran?

16:23.482 --> 16:25.484
[pensive music playing]

16:37.287 --> 16:39.832
[suspenseful music playing]

16:47.256 --> 16:49.508
What's this barrier? Did you create it?

16:56.890 --> 16:57.891
[gasps]

17:06.150 --> 17:07.776
[roaring]

17:10.779 --> 17:12.031
[young Bu-yeon] It's the fire bird.

17:14.491 --> 17:16.493
[dramatic music playing]

17:24.376 --> 17:26.712
The fire bird will soon dry out the world.

17:27.880 --> 17:30.924
I really hope that something so tragic
will never happen.

17:31.550 --> 17:35.012
But it seems the greed of humans
will burn the world to the ground.

17:35.763 --> 17:36.680
The fire bird…

17:38.057 --> 17:39.141
is going to be released?

17:39.224 --> 17:41.143
What I just finished showing you

17:41.977 --> 17:44.104
is what will happen to this world soon.

17:45.272 --> 17:48.859
I have foreseen
such things for a while now.

17:48.942 --> 17:50.694
So you're able to see the future?

17:52.029 --> 17:52.988
Who are you?

17:53.655 --> 17:54.490
Priestess?

17:55.491 --> 17:57.493
Was it you who used the jade to summon me?

17:57.993 --> 18:01.205
[young Bu-yeon] I was fearful
the world would fall into ruin again.

18:02.247 --> 18:06.376
I, ironically, contributed to its end
by summoning the fire bird.

18:07.544 --> 18:09.963
I can't stop this from happening.

18:11.048 --> 18:13.634
Only the one
who was born under the King's Star

18:13.717 --> 18:16.011
can possibly stop all of this.

18:19.598 --> 18:23.644
I have been hiding in the shadows
that was created by your light.

18:25.521 --> 18:28.148
Now I will leave the shadows
and step outside.

18:28.232 --> 18:29.608
You plan to no longer hide…

18:30.943 --> 18:32.152
and show your true self?

18:34.446 --> 18:35.364
I guess…

18:36.740 --> 18:37.991
you're Jin Bu-yeon then?

18:40.661 --> 18:41.578
That's right.

18:42.746 --> 18:45.165
That is the name I was given
when I was reborn.

18:47.042 --> 18:49.711
Jin Bu-yeon tried to attract your shadow…

18:51.255 --> 18:52.297
and use it…

18:54.049 --> 18:55.342
to make it disappear.

18:55.968 --> 18:58.512
The world that I foresaw
will undoubtedly come.

18:59.304 --> 19:00.139
When it does,

19:01.348 --> 19:03.433
tragedy will inevitably follow.

19:05.227 --> 19:07.229
[fire bird screeching]

19:13.318 --> 19:17.823
Just like how Jin Seol-ran helped
Seo Gyeong stop the Great Chaos,

19:18.699 --> 19:21.535
you are the only person
who can stop the fire bird,

19:22.619 --> 19:26.874
and Jin Bu-yeon's the only one
who can help you with this.

19:27.457 --> 19:29.459
[suspenseful music playing]

19:30.878 --> 19:32.254
[fire bird screeching]

19:34.214 --> 19:35.924
[screeching]

19:59.615 --> 20:02.075
[young Bu-yeon]
Jin Bu-yeon tried to attract your shadow…

20:03.827 --> 20:07.080
and use it to make it totally disappear.

20:08.373 --> 20:09.249
Did you meet…

20:11.877 --> 20:12.711
Jin Bu-yeon?

20:19.218 --> 20:20.219
Yes.

20:20.302 --> 20:22.512
[dramatic music playing]

20:25.349 --> 20:26.850
I have seen something that will…

20:31.271 --> 20:32.314
undoubtedly happen.

20:36.944 --> 20:39.029
[Sun] According to Jin Mu's plan,

20:39.112 --> 20:41.323
we must first take the fire bird
in Jinyowon.

20:41.406 --> 20:43.533
[mage 1] We must gather
the Unanimous Assembly again

20:43.617 --> 20:46.119
and confiscate the Jinyowon Plaque first.

20:46.203 --> 20:49.915
We should keep Songrim out of it,
but how do we justify that?

20:50.499 --> 20:52.376
[Monk Ho-yeon]
We must use Jang Uk as our reason.

20:53.085 --> 20:55.212
[mage 2] He disobeyed the King's command.

20:56.380 --> 20:57.464
[mage 3] That is right.

20:58.548 --> 20:59.883
[mage 1]
When should we gather the Assembly?

21:01.593 --> 21:03.178
Are you all right, Highness?

21:04.680 --> 21:05.764
[eunuch grunts]

21:05.847 --> 21:08.433
[ominous music playing]

21:11.186 --> 21:12.271
[eunuch screams]

21:22.406 --> 21:24.408
[foreboding music playing]

21:28.620 --> 21:31.540
Forget about the Assembly
and the Jinyowon Plaque.

21:31.623 --> 21:33.208
I don't have any time to waste.

21:34.459 --> 21:37.212
Let's go and take the fire bird
from Jinyowon right now.

21:40.674 --> 21:43.760
Why did His Majesty gather
the Assembly this late at night?

21:43.844 --> 21:45.304
I do not know why, Sire.

21:45.971 --> 21:48.181
But it appears that
one of the mages is a soul shifter,

21:49.182 --> 21:51.852
apparently fed on the energy
of one of the eunuchs.

21:53.145 --> 21:54.688
If there is a soul shifter here,

21:55.564 --> 21:56.982
His Majesty is in danger.

21:57.065 --> 21:59.151
- We have to stop him.
- I think the soul shifter

21:59.234 --> 22:00.319
could very well be…

22:01.653 --> 22:03.113
someone who you may already know.

22:03.196 --> 22:04.072
Someone I know?

22:06.366 --> 22:07.451
Who?

22:08.452 --> 22:09.703
It's me, Royal Highness.

22:16.877 --> 22:19.838
Are you not the relative of the Queen
from Seoho Fortress?

22:19.921 --> 22:22.215
Guess you don't recognize me
because of my appearance.

22:22.299 --> 22:23.342
It's me.

22:23.425 --> 22:26.970
Don't you know your own master,
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju,

22:27.763 --> 22:28.680
Jin Mu.

22:29.598 --> 22:30.432
Jin Mu?

22:30.515 --> 22:33.018
[tense music playing]

22:34.227 --> 22:35.437
How are you Jin Mu?

22:35.520 --> 22:37.397
I survived by shifting into this body.

22:38.231 --> 22:39.608
So you shifted your soul?

22:39.691 --> 22:42.569
Thanks to His Majesty for sending
someone for me to be able to do so.

22:42.652 --> 22:44.071
He saved you? Seriously?

22:44.154 --> 22:46.782
I've come back so I can help
the King and the Assembly

22:46.865 --> 22:48.200
finally achieve their own goal.

22:48.283 --> 22:49.117
You shut up!

22:49.743 --> 22:51.870
The King would never
join hands with you on this.

22:51.953 --> 22:53.413
[Sun] What Jin Mu is saying is true.

23:00.087 --> 23:02.214
Jin Mu will be with me and the Assembly.

23:02.798 --> 23:03.632
You can't.

23:03.715 --> 23:08.178
Jin Mu, did you say you wish to remove
the Crown Prince's Gold Plaque?

23:09.513 --> 23:10.514
Yes.

23:10.597 --> 23:12.432
[suspenseful music playing]

23:13.517 --> 23:16.019
He has stabbed me in the back once before,

23:17.020 --> 23:18.522
so I should return the favor.

23:20.941 --> 23:22.818
I hereby revoke your Gold Plaque.

23:24.069 --> 23:27.572
You are no longer the heir to the throne.

23:29.407 --> 23:31.493
[tense music playing]

23:33.662 --> 23:36.206
Keep him locked up in here
until I say otherwise.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.666
Yes.

23:38.667 --> 23:41.795
Majesty, you're being fooled by him.

23:43.964 --> 23:45.173
Majesty!

23:45.257 --> 23:46.091
[Eunuch Oh gasps]

23:51.930 --> 23:53.932
[music intensifies]

24:01.523 --> 24:02.357
Jin Mu.

24:04.526 --> 24:08.113
Why are you trying to deceive
the King and the Assembly?

24:08.196 --> 24:10.448
I'm merely picking up where I left off.

24:13.994 --> 24:16.496
I shall now head to Jinyowon
and take out the fire bird.

24:18.665 --> 24:21.585
[foreboding music playing]

24:24.254 --> 24:25.088
[scoffs]

24:40.687 --> 24:43.773
Is Young Lady Jin
also not here with you then?

24:45.192 --> 24:46.860
Is she with Young Master Jang?

24:48.778 --> 24:49.738
Please Lady Jin.

24:50.989 --> 24:53.033
Can you tell me
what's going on between those two?

24:54.701 --> 24:56.953
I'm sorry. I cannot tell you
anything right now.

24:57.704 --> 24:59.372
Everything will be resolved in time,

24:59.998 --> 25:01.583
so please have some patience.

25:02.167 --> 25:05.295
So you mean to say
you know what's actually going on?

25:06.838 --> 25:07.672
[sighs]

25:09.007 --> 25:09.841
Maidservant Kim.

25:10.425 --> 25:12.677
My mother still hasn't recovered just yet

25:13.178 --> 25:14.930
after helping out Young Master Seo.

25:15.931 --> 25:18.433
She needs to rest, so please go back home.

25:18.516 --> 25:19.476
[footsteps approaching]

25:21.811 --> 25:24.731
Lady Jin,
the Unanimous Assembly has arrived.

25:25.565 --> 25:26.399
What?

25:28.235 --> 25:29.110
[sighs worriedly]

25:34.115 --> 25:35.700
What do you think you're doing?

25:35.784 --> 25:38.495
How dare you enter Jinyowon
without my permission!

25:39.871 --> 25:41.873
Apologies, Lady Jin.

25:41.957 --> 25:46.086
We much fetch the artifact
that is needed for the rite for the lake.

25:47.128 --> 25:48.338
Open the door, please.

25:48.421 --> 25:50.340
You came here at this hour

25:50.423 --> 25:52.676
just for the artifact
for the rite of the lake?

25:52.759 --> 25:55.095
The royal family approved us
to retrieve it,

25:55.178 --> 25:57.138
so I'm telling you now, open the door!

25:57.222 --> 25:58.306
I can't do that.

25:58.848 --> 26:01.226
Even if it's an order
from the royal family.

26:01.977 --> 26:05.188
Have you all forgotten
that we possess the Jinyowon Plaque?

26:05.272 --> 26:09.651
Since all the mages of the Assembly
except Songrim are here,

26:10.318 --> 26:12.070
we shall confiscate the plaque.

26:12.946 --> 26:14.489
[Monk Ho-yeon] Please hand it over.

26:14.572 --> 26:17.909
You have no right to do that.
I won't hand it over.

26:17.993 --> 26:19.369
Enough! Enough! Enough!

26:20.996 --> 26:22.998
[tense music playing]

26:23.790 --> 26:25.083
There's no time for this!

26:30.755 --> 26:31.881
- [body thuds]
- [sword clanks]

26:33.633 --> 26:34.676
[Ho-gyeong grunts]

26:37.595 --> 26:38.555
[chokes]

26:38.638 --> 26:41.349
- Mother!
- Move another inch and she will die!

26:43.184 --> 26:44.144
Ho-gyeong.

26:45.603 --> 26:48.023
Your brother has shifted souls.

26:48.106 --> 26:51.860
Open that door before I suck
all the energy out of the Jin family…

26:52.569 --> 26:53.737
you're so proud of.

26:55.697 --> 26:56.740
[Yun-o] Jin Cho-yeon!

26:59.117 --> 27:00.702
Open the door now.

27:00.785 --> 27:04.164
Or I'll drain all your mother's energy
until she withers away.

27:05.498 --> 27:06.374
Mother…

27:06.458 --> 27:07.584
[chokes]

27:10.045 --> 27:12.464
Open the door. Right now!

27:15.842 --> 27:17.135
He is a soul shifter.

27:17.218 --> 27:19.220
If he feeds on her, she will die!

27:19.304 --> 27:20.430
Hurry up! Open it!

27:23.892 --> 27:25.685
[heavy breathing]

27:29.939 --> 27:31.941
[tense music playing]

27:42.494 --> 27:43.328
[door thuds]

27:46.790 --> 27:48.583
[breathing shakily]

27:52.712 --> 27:53.713
[chuckles]

27:55.340 --> 27:56.508
[gasps]

27:58.635 --> 28:01.012
Go to Songrim
and ask them to send help now.

28:01.888 --> 28:02.931
[whispers]
Hurry up!

28:06.768 --> 28:07.769
Mother!

28:11.898 --> 28:14.609
[dramatic music playing]

28:45.223 --> 28:46.057
[relic clangs]

28:46.766 --> 28:49.144
[loud rumbling]

28:57.402 --> 29:00.488
Mother, are you all right?

29:05.785 --> 29:07.912
Is that the fire bird egg?

29:09.748 --> 29:12.000
- [loud rumbling]
- [mages gasp]

29:12.083 --> 29:14.085
- [mage 1] What is that?
- [mage 2] What's going on?

29:14.169 --> 29:17.255
Jinyowon must be collapsing
since we took out the fire bird egg.

29:17.964 --> 29:19.090
We must leave now.

29:29.642 --> 29:30.643
Sister.

29:32.562 --> 29:35.857
I could have fed on your energy,
but I couldn't bear it.

29:36.441 --> 29:39.319
Because anything belonging
to Jinyowon makes me sick.

29:43.198 --> 29:44.908
[sobbing]

29:44.991 --> 29:47.619
Mother, your wound is really deep.

29:49.662 --> 29:51.664
We can't let them take the egg.

29:52.290 --> 29:55.168
Songrim. Go there at once
and ask them for help.

29:56.377 --> 29:57.837
[sobs]

29:57.921 --> 29:59.547
Jin Cho-yeon! Go right now!

29:59.631 --> 30:00.465
Now!

30:02.383 --> 30:03.218
Yes.

30:04.385 --> 30:05.595
[sobbing]

30:09.557 --> 30:11.142
[rumbling]

30:14.979 --> 30:16.856
[Bu-yeon pants]

30:22.612 --> 30:23.530
[Bu-yeon] Jinyowon…

30:24.489 --> 30:25.490
is collapsing.

30:26.449 --> 30:29.160
- [loud rumbling]
- [otherworldly whispers]

30:37.085 --> 30:38.044
It can't be.

30:38.545 --> 30:39.504
No!

30:42.549 --> 30:45.468
[relics shrieking]

30:47.178 --> 30:48.012
[Maid Kim] Lady Jin.

30:48.805 --> 30:52.058
Lady Jin, are you all right?

30:52.141 --> 30:55.395
Won't you please take me inside Jinyowon?

30:55.478 --> 30:57.313
If Jinyowon collapses,

30:57.397 --> 31:00.775
all the relics inside will escape at once.

31:01.860 --> 31:04.863
I must use my powers to keep them in.

31:07.198 --> 31:11.035
[relics shrieking, growling]

31:13.496 --> 31:15.081
- Please hold onto me.
- [exclaims]

31:15.957 --> 31:17.125
I'll take you inside.

31:19.127 --> 31:20.461
[groans]

31:27.176 --> 31:29.304
[grandiose music playing]

31:36.769 --> 31:37.729
My lord.

31:39.105 --> 31:40.773
- Young Master Park.
- Are you okay, Cho-yeon?

31:40.857 --> 31:43.401
The Assembly's mages have taken
the fire bird.

31:44.444 --> 31:45.695
Jinyowon is about to collapse.

31:49.574 --> 31:51.618
I'll go and check Jinyowon myself.

31:52.577 --> 31:54.662
Go after the mages who took the fire bird.

31:55.413 --> 31:56.247
Yes.

31:56.331 --> 31:59.334
The fire bird is a dangerous relic,
so I'll go with Young Master Park.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.461
My mother is severely injured.

32:02.086 --> 32:04.088
She needs help, please, Lord Park.

32:04.881 --> 32:05.715
Okay.

32:12.305 --> 32:13.181
Please take it.

32:14.390 --> 32:16.601
[suspenseful music playing]

32:28.488 --> 32:29.697
Where is Lady Jin?

32:30.531 --> 32:32.951
They said she went inside
to guard the relics.

32:33.034 --> 32:35.036
Also, Maidservant Kim went
in there with her.

32:35.119 --> 32:36.287
Maidservant Kim?

32:38.414 --> 32:40.375
Maidservant Kim is inside Jinyowon?

32:46.589 --> 32:47.757
[Maid Kim grunts]

32:48.841 --> 32:50.051
[Jin] Maidservant Kim!

32:50.134 --> 32:52.512
Maidservant Kim, are you in there?

32:53.888 --> 32:56.516
Lord Park, yes, I'm right here!

32:57.976 --> 32:59.978
[relics growl]

33:03.106 --> 33:04.941
[gasps]
The relics are escaping!

33:05.733 --> 33:07.193
If Jinyowon collapses,

33:07.276 --> 33:10.071
all these relics will create
chaos in this world!

33:11.280 --> 33:12.532
I must seal the door.

33:13.408 --> 33:15.201
Maidservant Kim, hurry up and leave.

33:15.284 --> 33:16.577
If you do not, you will die.

33:16.661 --> 33:17.537
What?

33:18.246 --> 33:21.666
All the relics in here will be released
into the world.

33:21.749 --> 33:23.251
I have to seal the door!

33:25.336 --> 33:26.254
What about you?

33:28.715 --> 33:29.966
- [yelps]
- [Maid Kim exclaims]

33:31.300 --> 33:33.219
Maidservant Kim!

33:34.012 --> 33:35.722
[relic growls]

33:39.642 --> 33:42.061
- It looks like it will collapse soon!
- [relic growls]

33:42.145 --> 33:45.189
If we don't seal the door,
all the relics will escape!

33:45.273 --> 33:46.107
Not yet!

33:46.649 --> 33:48.985
I can't seal it yet. Maidservant Kim is…

33:52.196 --> 33:55.283
[voice breaking]
My wife is in there.

33:56.492 --> 33:58.786
[relic shrieks, growls]

33:59.912 --> 34:00.997
[Maid Kim] My lord!

34:01.748 --> 34:02.582
Seal…

34:03.583 --> 34:04.459
the door.

34:05.293 --> 34:06.794
[breathing heavily]

34:08.212 --> 34:10.214
[tragic music playing]

34:18.723 --> 34:20.475
Maidservant Kim!

34:23.853 --> 34:26.105
It will be a disaster if you don't.

34:27.273 --> 34:28.107
So, please…

34:29.901 --> 34:30.735
seal it now.

34:35.698 --> 34:38.451
[sobs]
I understand, my lord.

34:40.620 --> 34:41.996
So please, my lord.

34:42.497 --> 34:43.664
It will be all right.

34:45.792 --> 34:47.710
[Maid Kim] Hurry! Seal the door.

34:49.087 --> 34:50.004
Hurry!

34:51.506 --> 34:53.925
[mage] My lord! It's about to collapse!

35:04.894 --> 35:07.605
[dramatic music playing]

35:22.620 --> 35:24.080
[door rumbling]

35:27.291 --> 35:29.710
[Maid Kim] Even if you do decide
to close that door, my lord,

35:30.586 --> 35:34.048
I know just how heartbreaking
it will be for you,

35:34.632 --> 35:36.300
so it doesn't upset me much.

35:37.552 --> 35:39.554
[somber music playing]

35:47.687 --> 35:49.272
[sobs]

35:50.356 --> 35:51.566
[yells]

35:52.066 --> 35:53.359
[Ho-gyeong grunts]

36:02.118 --> 36:04.120
[somber music continues playing]

36:11.294 --> 36:13.838
[sobbing]

36:13.921 --> 36:16.507
[wailing]

36:42.867 --> 36:44.410
[Maid Kim] I like it here just fine.

36:45.786 --> 36:46.621
Yeon…

36:47.413 --> 36:49.624
[sobs, sniffles]

36:51.375 --> 36:55.171
Yeon…
[cries]

37:07.725 --> 37:09.727
[intense music playing]

37:12.855 --> 37:13.689
[mage grunts]

37:27.078 --> 37:28.454
Lord Park Jin.

37:29.330 --> 37:30.623
Do not fall in despair.

37:31.499 --> 37:33.626
You still have a chance to save her.

37:35.336 --> 37:38.839
I'll give you the power
to save the person you love so much.

37:43.469 --> 37:45.471
[suspenseful music playing]

38:03.864 --> 38:04.865
Your Majesty…

38:06.158 --> 38:07.243
is this what you…

38:08.911 --> 38:11.080
and the Assembly both want to do?

38:11.163 --> 38:12.373
I have told you,

38:13.249 --> 38:15.543
everyone wants the power of the ice stone.

38:15.626 --> 38:18.296
Songrim can't keep it all to themselves.

38:18.379 --> 38:22.466
Divide the power among
the most dominant mage families of Daeho

38:22.550 --> 38:25.845
and use it by mutual agreement.

38:25.928 --> 38:27.179
You plan to release…

38:28.806 --> 38:33.227
the fire bird into the world
just to achieve something so small?

38:33.311 --> 38:35.646
Once we get the ice stone
along with the rain

38:35.730 --> 38:37.315
from the rite for the lake,

38:38.649 --> 38:40.026
we will just seal it up again.

38:40.109 --> 38:44.071
Then are you saying
you don't even care about the world

38:44.697 --> 38:46.657
that will completely burn because of it?

38:47.950 --> 38:50.369
All things require some kind of sacrifice.

38:51.370 --> 38:52.997
If you worry about little things,

38:53.080 --> 38:55.333
you'll never
accomplish anything truly great.

38:55.958 --> 38:57.376
You must save Maidservant Kim.

38:58.252 --> 38:59.462
Do you not wish to do that?

39:00.963 --> 39:02.381
[Yun-o] Don't be a hypocrite here.

39:10.097 --> 39:10.931
Evil…

39:12.475 --> 39:15.770
always does what it wants
without ever stopping.

39:17.646 --> 39:18.939
Why this virtue…

39:20.232 --> 39:24.320
always have to prove itself
over and over again?

39:26.072 --> 39:26.947
[scoffs]

39:27.948 --> 39:28.783
Yes.

39:29.700 --> 39:30.951
I do want to save her.

39:32.828 --> 39:36.123
Even if it makes me lose my mind,
and no matter what it takes from me.

39:37.416 --> 39:39.502
I want that.
[chuckles sadly]

39:40.711 --> 39:41.712
But even so…

39:43.422 --> 39:44.256
I will…

39:47.051 --> 39:49.887
stop you all from doing any of this.

39:52.139 --> 39:53.891
Not a single one of you…

39:55.142 --> 39:57.436
has any right to be laughing at me…

39:58.813 --> 40:00.481
[laughs angrily]

40:00.564 --> 40:01.941
…and call me a…

40:06.112 --> 40:07.154
hypocrite.

40:07.238 --> 40:09.907
[tense music playing]

40:11.367 --> 40:12.201
[scoffs]

40:30.761 --> 40:31.679
[grunting]

40:42.106 --> 40:43.399
[Yun-o] If you don't stop…

40:47.778 --> 40:50.322
I'll break the barrier
of the fire bird right here.

41:02.376 --> 41:03.210
[sword clanks]

41:03.294 --> 41:05.171
[tense music continues playing]

41:21.020 --> 41:21.854
[grunts]

41:53.677 --> 41:54.803
[soft groan]

41:57.181 --> 41:58.516
[thuds]

42:07.149 --> 42:09.693
This place will be consumed by fire.

42:10.402 --> 42:11.403
We have to leave.

42:21.914 --> 42:25.084
He fought against
the representatives from eight families.

42:25.751 --> 42:27.795
He really was a high-level mage.

42:28.379 --> 42:29.255
What a waste of power!

42:29.338 --> 42:33.133
If only he had joined us,
he could've enjoyed eternal life as well.

42:33.217 --> 42:36.845
But he willingly chose death,
I guess it's his loss.

42:38.264 --> 42:39.139
[sighs]

42:59.660 --> 43:01.662
[tragic music playing]

43:07.876 --> 43:09.753
[coughs]

43:14.341 --> 43:15.384
[gasps]

43:21.515 --> 43:23.392
[breathes roughly]

43:55.549 --> 43:59.011
[all sobbing]

44:00.721 --> 44:01.597
[man cries]
Lord Park!

44:03.974 --> 44:06.602
[mournful music playing]

44:14.193 --> 44:15.694
[Sun-i sniffles, sobs]

44:19.907 --> 44:21.575
[sniffles]
Hey, Uk.

44:22.701 --> 44:23.702
Hey, Uk.

44:23.786 --> 44:25.871
Uk, Jin is… Jin is…

44:25.954 --> 44:27.373
Jin is…

44:30.542 --> 44:32.586
[all crying]

44:38.258 --> 44:40.260
[dramatic music playing]

44:51.522 --> 44:54.191
[Cho-yeong and Dang-gu sobbing]

45:02.199 --> 45:04.034
[Dang-gu sobbing]

45:14.086 --> 45:15.087
Late last night,

45:16.338 --> 45:18.132
the fire bird in Jinyowon was taken out.

45:18.715 --> 45:21.260
Lady Jin and Maidservant Kim went inside

45:21.343 --> 45:23.512
in an attempt
to stop the relics from escaping…

45:26.056 --> 45:27.141
and passed away.

45:27.224 --> 45:31.478
The collapsed door couldn't even be opened
with Jin Cho-yeon's powers,

45:32.479 --> 45:34.106
so we couldn't get their bodies.

45:34.189 --> 45:35.149
And so…

45:36.817 --> 45:38.277
their coffins are empty for now.

45:38.944 --> 45:42.573
As for Lord Park, he tried to stop
the fire bird's barrier from breaking,

45:44.074 --> 45:46.660
but the fire bird's energy
set the place on fire.

45:46.743 --> 45:47.911
He passed away there.

45:49.288 --> 45:50.831
[Seo Yul] The place was so badly burned.

45:51.498 --> 45:53.542
The only thing
we could retrieve was his sword.

45:53.625 --> 45:56.128
I've been locked up
after they took my plaque.

45:58.005 --> 45:59.631
I narrowly escaped the fire.

46:00.299 --> 46:02.259
Even my father, the King…

46:03.969 --> 46:05.387
took Jin Mu's side on this.

46:05.971 --> 46:06.889
It all happened…

46:08.515 --> 46:10.184
because Jin Mu shifted souls.

46:10.767 --> 46:12.436
[Cho-yeon] He's now in Seo Yun-o's body.

46:12.519 --> 46:15.481
[Dang-gu] I want nothing more than
to barge into Cheonbugwan right now,

46:16.482 --> 46:18.150
but they have the fire bird with them.

46:20.277 --> 46:22.571
We cannot afford to act so rashly.

46:22.654 --> 46:25.157
If people discover
the fire bird was released,

46:25.240 --> 46:26.575
there will be total chaos.

46:26.658 --> 46:28.994
Let us first quietly hold the funeral.

46:29.077 --> 46:31.330
Then we must stop
the fire bird at all cost.

46:32.706 --> 46:33.916
The fire bird will awaken.

46:36.502 --> 46:37.419
Yes.

46:38.754 --> 46:40.464
I was told that would undoubtedly happen.

46:42.633 --> 46:43.592
However…

46:46.762 --> 46:48.222
these three are still alive.

46:48.305 --> 46:50.557
[suspenseful music playing]

46:52.142 --> 46:53.018
[gasps]

46:53.101 --> 46:55.812
With the foreseen chaos
created by human greed,

46:55.896 --> 46:58.690
the humans will to stop it
can be a variable…

47:00.943 --> 47:02.611
and can possibly change the outcome.

47:05.239 --> 47:06.114
[Maid Kim sobs]

47:09.159 --> 47:10.577
[sobbing continues]

47:14.790 --> 47:16.500
[sobs, sniffles]

47:20.546 --> 47:22.172
I'm sure Jin will be all right.

47:24.341 --> 47:26.468
- Don't cry so much, Maid Kim.
- Yeah.

47:30.639 --> 47:31.473
[Maid Kim sniffles]

47:34.309 --> 47:35.978
[sniffles]

47:41.275 --> 47:44.319
Lady Jin, you've used up
too much of your energy.

47:46.738 --> 47:48.240
The fire bird was taken,

47:49.908 --> 47:52.244
and I couldn't even manage
to stop the relics…

47:54.204 --> 47:55.581
from escaping into the world.

47:55.664 --> 47:58.584
You risked your own life
and did your absolute best.

48:01.336 --> 48:03.255
Was it Bu-yeon who entered Jinyowon…

48:05.090 --> 48:06.216
before it collapsed?

48:06.300 --> 48:07.217
That's correct.

48:08.135 --> 48:10.721
Jinyowon's door had also been built
by Jin Seol-ran.

48:11.805 --> 48:15.559
Bu-yeon created a door that allowed her
to enter Jinyowon from Danhyanggok.

48:20.689 --> 48:22.691
[dramatic music playing]

48:23.692 --> 48:27.487
[Master Lee] While she entered Jinyowon
and stopped it from collapsing,

48:28.572 --> 48:32.367
I followed her instructions
and went to find the fire bird.

48:35.412 --> 48:36.997
I was unable to find it.

48:38.373 --> 48:40.125
But fortunately, I was able to save Jin.

48:41.960 --> 48:44.963
Does that mean Naksu is now fully…

48:46.590 --> 48:48.133
gone from Bu-yeon's body?

48:48.216 --> 48:49.343
Yes, she's gone.

48:50.594 --> 48:53.513
And that's why the body's divine powers
have returned in full.

48:54.306 --> 48:56.099
[breathes deeply]

49:01.563 --> 49:03.357
It took so long to find each other again.

49:05.359 --> 49:07.819
But the two of you were not
even given a full day together.

49:11.365 --> 49:13.408
[somber music playing]

49:31.259 --> 49:32.094
These jades…

49:33.553 --> 49:35.722
are shared by couples
in order to stay together.

49:36.306 --> 49:37.307
But I don't think…

49:40.644 --> 49:42.521
we can share it any longer, Jang Uk.

49:44.940 --> 49:46.942
[tender music playing]

49:58.161 --> 50:00.580
["Raindrops" by Gummy playing]

50:12.092 --> 50:13.677
[Bu-yeon] When I recall that last memory…

50:15.846 --> 50:17.347
I'll give you a sign like this.

50:25.731 --> 50:26.857
I guess we weren't…

50:29.484 --> 50:31.570
meant to recognize each other
at first sight.

50:33.113 --> 50:35.282
Your father, Cho Chung,
died as I was being born.

50:37.075 --> 50:38.702
And you had to kill me to avenge him.

50:40.036 --> 50:40.871
You're right.

50:42.038 --> 50:43.790
According to that terrible fate,

50:45.792 --> 50:47.335
we probably should have never met.

50:48.253 --> 50:49.171
However…

50:51.047 --> 50:52.507
we were able to recognize each other…

50:53.759 --> 50:55.552
regardless of our own fates.

50:57.053 --> 50:57.888
We…

50:59.014 --> 51:02.601
were the light in each other's lives
that shined when we needed it the most.

51:03.268 --> 51:04.895
We embraced even the shadows and…

51:07.022 --> 51:08.774
chose to keep loving each other.

51:10.776 --> 51:11.693
So now…

51:14.029 --> 51:15.322
I can only say…

51:18.450 --> 51:20.869
one more thing to you in our final moment.

51:30.462 --> 51:31.338
I love you.

51:34.674 --> 51:36.676
["Raindrops" continues playing]

51:55.570 --> 51:56.738
[breathes shakily]

52:45.787 --> 52:46.663
[sighs]

52:51.209 --> 52:54.087
[Yun-o] Not only is Songrim mourning,
but we have the fire bird.

52:54.170 --> 52:56.965
So we cannot easily
be attacked by them or Jang Uk.

52:57.591 --> 53:00.969
Tonight, we wake the fire bird,
then we perform the rite for the lake.

53:01.052 --> 53:04.264
So then after tonight, I will be able to

53:04.347 --> 53:06.975
use the ice stone and abandon this body.

53:08.602 --> 53:11.771
There could be those
who try to interfere with us,

53:11.855 --> 53:14.024
so please gather
all the guards around here

53:14.107 --> 53:15.650
and have them protect Cheonbugwan.

53:15.734 --> 53:18.612
I'll send my army to Cheonbugwan.

53:18.695 --> 53:20.572
So safely awaken the fire bird

53:21.156 --> 53:22.991
and bring the ice stone to me.

53:28.955 --> 53:29.956
[Jang Uk] Royal Highness,

53:30.457 --> 53:32.876
please stop the King
from mobilizing his army immediately.

53:35.378 --> 53:36.838
I don't have the plaque with me,

53:37.505 --> 53:39.633
so I can't do anything
to stop him right now.

53:41.801 --> 53:42.636
[sighs]

53:43.678 --> 53:45.680
[tense music playing]

53:45.764 --> 53:46.806
Please use this plaque.

53:48.600 --> 53:50.518
But that's the plaque
the late king left for you.

53:51.853 --> 53:53.480
Right now, the king this country needs

53:53.563 --> 53:57.067
is not one who doesn't care whether or not
the entire world burns to ashes,

53:58.735 --> 54:00.612
but one who stops that from happening.

54:10.538 --> 54:12.499
I even stole and used
the King's Star before.

54:12.582 --> 54:15.043
But now, I'll be using
your Gold Plaque as well.

54:15.835 --> 54:16.670
Jang Uk.

54:19.673 --> 54:22.676
Have you really never dreamed
of rising to the highest position…

54:23.927 --> 54:24.761
in this life?

54:27.263 --> 54:28.890
I've already climbed to the…

54:30.016 --> 54:32.602
highest point I wanted to reach
in this life or the next…

54:34.187 --> 54:35.355
with the person I love.

54:37.565 --> 54:38.400
That is…

54:41.695 --> 54:42.821
more than enough for me.

54:46.449 --> 54:48.451
[suspenseful music playing]

54:56.751 --> 54:58.795
While we perform the rite for the lake,

54:58.878 --> 55:01.339
the King will send his army
to Cheonbugwan to protect it.

55:02.549 --> 55:04.509
Jang Uk might try to stop us.

55:05.760 --> 55:07.762
What are you worried about
when we have the fire bird.

55:07.846 --> 55:09.055
Park Jin tried, didn't he?

55:09.639 --> 55:12.350
And he could do nothing
to stop us despite his power.

55:12.434 --> 55:15.270
I guess once we break the bird's barrier,

55:15.353 --> 55:17.772
no one will be able to stop us.

55:17.856 --> 55:20.150
Awakening the fire bird is dangerous.

55:20.233 --> 55:23.278
Should the flames graze us
as we try to break the barrier,

55:23.361 --> 55:25.864
we'll all be reduced to ashes on the spot.

55:25.947 --> 55:28.283
If the fire bird fails to fly
into the sky,

55:28.366 --> 55:30.326
and its fire energy bursts in the flames,

55:32.954 --> 55:34.706
all of Daeho will burn to ashes.

55:35.290 --> 55:37.125
No one will try to do anything…

55:40.628 --> 55:42.130
for fear of wakening it.

55:49.345 --> 55:52.766
I've decided to go to Cheonbugwan
to wake the fire bird.

55:54.893 --> 55:57.896
But wait, why are you trying to awaken it?

55:57.979 --> 55:59.773
If this is something that must happen,

56:00.690 --> 56:03.693
it's better if it happens
while we have control,

56:04.360 --> 56:06.821
then we'll be able to change the outcome.

56:07.739 --> 56:09.282
[Jang Uk] I will contain its fire energy

56:09.365 --> 56:11.451
where the energy of the skies
reach the land,

56:11.534 --> 56:13.453
then use water energy to get rid of it.

56:14.162 --> 56:15.288
To do that,

56:16.372 --> 56:17.665
I must wake the fire bird.

56:18.249 --> 56:20.251
[dramatic music playing]

56:35.809 --> 56:38.103
After thoroughly examining
the sky's energy,

56:38.186 --> 56:41.231
I discovered the fire's energy
will be strongest tonight.

56:41.314 --> 56:45.151
The nineteenth hour is when I'll initiate
the rite of the lake.

56:55.495 --> 56:59.707
They say Cheonbugwan will be
performing the rite for the lake tonight.

56:59.791 --> 57:00.667
Tonight?

57:01.960 --> 57:05.839
Have all the guards in the city
been sent to Cheonbugwan yet?

57:05.922 --> 57:09.551
The leader of the guard will soon give
his report to you, Royal Highness.

57:09.634 --> 57:10.468
That's good.

57:11.678 --> 57:13.638
[laughs]

57:17.559 --> 57:19.769
[suspenseful music continues playing]

57:44.252 --> 57:45.753
Is it not the nineteenth hour?

57:45.837 --> 57:48.965
Why hasn't he given me
his report already, Eunuch?

57:49.048 --> 57:50.633
The guards won't be
going anywhere, Father.

57:50.717 --> 57:52.969
[percussive music playing]

57:59.851 --> 58:00.810
I have…

58:02.145 --> 58:04.606
withdrawn the direct order
that you have given.

58:04.689 --> 58:06.107
What is that?

58:07.317 --> 58:08.651
A Gold Plaque?

58:11.362 --> 58:13.698
It's the one you've been afraid
of your whole life.

58:14.824 --> 58:16.868
The person who was born
under the King's Star.

58:19.537 --> 58:20.371
The King's Star?

58:20.455 --> 58:21.998
The man who holds the King's Star

58:22.790 --> 58:25.126
will put a stop to
what is happening at Cheonbugwan.

58:26.544 --> 58:27.504
[breathes shakily]

58:28.254 --> 58:29.088
Now, Father.

58:31.716 --> 58:33.676
It's time you step down from the throne…

58:36.846 --> 58:38.515
that has always made you anxious.

58:45.647 --> 58:46.523
[exclaims]

58:52.111 --> 58:53.154
[breathes shakily]

58:55.323 --> 58:58.034
[mages shouting]

59:05.917 --> 59:07.919
[tense music playing]

59:17.220 --> 59:18.054
[grunting]

59:19.138 --> 59:20.765
[mages shouting, grunting]

59:36.281 --> 59:38.283
[tense music continues playing]

59:43.997 --> 59:46.249
[tense music intensifies]

59:55.550 --> 59:57.760
These dangerous relics
that help the fire bird,

59:58.553 --> 01:00:01.681
all have to be found
and must be destroyed.

01:00:02.181 --> 01:00:04.267
- Hurry, find them!
- [female mage] Yes, Young Lady.

01:00:06.144 --> 01:00:07.270
[sighs worriedly]

01:00:13.568 --> 01:00:15.653
They say Songrim has entered Cheonbugwan.

01:00:16.279 --> 01:00:18.906
It is not yet time, but let's begin.

01:00:18.990 --> 01:00:21.993
It's dangerous to rush.
If the energy explodes, we will all die.

01:00:22.076 --> 01:00:23.995
If they take the fire bird,
it's over for us anyway!

01:00:24.078 --> 01:00:25.663
That is better than burning to death.

01:00:26.372 --> 01:00:27.415
You can count me out.

01:00:32.670 --> 01:00:33.546
[grunts]

01:00:34.839 --> 01:00:35.965
[body thuds]

01:00:38.217 --> 01:00:41.262
No one here can stop now, understand!
If you stop, you will die.

01:00:43.514 --> 01:00:44.474
Now…

01:00:45.725 --> 01:00:47.560
all of you wake the fire bird!

01:00:47.644 --> 01:00:49.228
[Monk Ho-yeon] Jin Mu is right.

01:00:49.312 --> 01:00:52.774
Let's wake the fire bird
to get the ice stone.

01:01:02.742 --> 01:01:04.327
[percussive music playing]

01:01:09.957 --> 01:01:12.377
- [loud blast]
- [all scream]

01:01:13.711 --> 01:01:16.172
You should have been careful.
Why is it suddenly starting to wake now?

01:01:21.177 --> 01:01:23.179
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:31.270 --> 01:01:33.523
Jang Uk. What are you doing?

01:01:33.606 --> 01:01:35.608
I am helping all of you
awaken the fire bird.

01:01:42.240 --> 01:01:44.826
[mages exclaim]

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:48.329
[Monk Ho-yeon] Stop, Jang Uk!

01:01:48.996 --> 01:01:52.917
If the fire bird's energy were to explode,
we would all die!

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:54.627
Did you really think it'd be fine

01:01:55.211 --> 01:01:57.755
if you survived
while the world burned to ashes?

01:02:00.216 --> 01:02:01.884
I'm sorry, but I won't allow that.

01:02:01.968 --> 01:02:02.802
Jang Uk.

01:02:03.469 --> 01:02:05.304
Surely, you wouldn't allow
the whole Assembly to die!

01:02:06.764 --> 01:02:09.016
Is this not the kind of world
you so desperately wanted?

01:02:09.892 --> 01:02:13.438
Get a clear look at what it is like
for someone with immense strength to gain…

01:02:15.314 --> 01:02:16.858
and wield even greater power.

01:02:20.194 --> 01:02:22.363
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:27.410 --> 01:02:29.328
[all screaming]

01:02:36.586 --> 01:02:37.670
Jang Uk.

01:02:46.512 --> 01:02:48.181
You were right all along.

01:02:49.432 --> 01:02:52.059
In a world where those with greater power…

01:02:53.102 --> 01:02:55.938
take everything, the weak shall perish.

01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:03.279
[laughs evilly]

01:03:14.373 --> 01:03:18.169
[laughs]

01:03:20.588 --> 01:03:23.800
[evil laughter]

01:03:59.710 --> 01:04:02.880
Jin Bu-yeon has safely
entered Cheonbugwan.

01:04:03.631 --> 01:04:06.843
She and Yul are waiting for the fire bird
by the constellation basin.

01:04:08.427 --> 01:04:09.262
[Jang Uk] Okay.

01:04:10.930 --> 01:04:12.807
Take this to Jin Bu-yeon and tell her

01:04:13.724 --> 01:04:16.978
I'll be waiting at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:04:22.817 --> 01:04:24.652
[ethereal music playing]

01:04:25.570 --> 01:04:28.739
Thanks to the Crown Prince,
I found Uk's constellation plate.

01:04:37.832 --> 01:04:39.125
Is the fire bird still safe?

01:04:45.923 --> 01:04:48.050
This is Jin Bu-yeon
with her regained powers.

01:04:48.551 --> 01:04:49.760
And the fire bird is safe.

01:04:53.848 --> 01:04:55.391
She will soon awaken it inside here.

01:04:59.937 --> 01:05:02.398
We destroyed the relics
that will prevent the fire bird

01:05:02.481 --> 01:05:03.691
from going to the lake.

01:05:04.650 --> 01:05:07.028
[intense music playing]

01:05:21.918 --> 01:05:24.879
[Go Won] The star in the center
of the Big Dipper is the King's Star.

01:05:29.008 --> 01:05:30.217
Now she'll wake it…

01:05:31.719 --> 01:05:33.137
and send it to the King's Star.

01:05:33.804 --> 01:05:35.848
I heard that the seven stars gather

01:05:36.349 --> 01:05:38.809
all of their energy
and send it to the King's Star.

01:05:38.893 --> 01:05:41.395
But now, there's only six of us.

01:05:41.479 --> 01:05:44.106
Not exactly, there are seven.

01:05:45.149 --> 01:05:46.817
There's one more person who has…

01:05:49.695 --> 01:05:51.030
always been by Uk.

01:05:51.739 --> 01:05:52.782
She'll wake the fire bird…

01:05:54.450 --> 01:05:56.327
and send it to Uk
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:05:58.412 --> 01:06:00.414
[dramatic music playing]

01:06:37.326 --> 01:06:39.203
[roars]

01:06:47.420 --> 01:06:48.504
[all murmuring]

01:06:48.587 --> 01:06:50.006
[man] Do you know what that is?

01:06:51.549 --> 01:06:52.383
[fire bird shrieking]

01:06:53.259 --> 01:06:55.052
The fire bird is awake.

01:07:05.479 --> 01:07:07.481
[suspenseful music playing]

01:07:16.407 --> 01:07:17.658
[woman exclaims]
What is that?

01:07:17.742 --> 01:07:19.702
[loud rumbling]

01:07:45.019 --> 01:07:46.187
[fire bird roars]

01:07:52.234 --> 01:07:54.904
[grandiose music playing]

01:07:58.741 --> 01:07:59.575
[exhales]

01:08:00.326 --> 01:08:03.287
[fire bird growls]

01:08:23.724 --> 01:08:25.976
[roars angrily]

01:08:28.896 --> 01:08:29.730
[grunts]

01:08:31.690 --> 01:08:33.943
[grandiose music continues playing]

01:08:42.535 --> 01:08:45.037
[shrieks, roars]

01:08:47.957 --> 01:08:50.334
[shrieks in pain]

01:09:12.189 --> 01:09:13.816
Jang Uk has finally done it.

01:09:15.401 --> 01:09:16.235
The fire bird…

01:09:17.736 --> 01:09:18.654
is no more.

01:09:18.737 --> 01:09:20.239
[all exclaim in relief]

01:09:34.753 --> 01:09:36.297
- [Seo Yul] Bu-yeon.
- [Go Won] Shaman.

01:09:36.380 --> 01:09:37.464
[Cho-yeon] Bu-yeon.

01:09:45.681 --> 01:09:47.641
[epic music playing]

01:10:22.259 --> 01:10:24.053
[young Bu-yeon]
The light that saved the world,

01:10:25.679 --> 01:10:27.681
this is the shadow I return to you.

01:10:30.017 --> 01:10:32.061
A light that has embraced a shadow

01:10:32.937 --> 01:10:35.731
shall never step into the darkness.

01:10:45.699 --> 01:10:47.660
1 YEAR LATER

01:10:47.743 --> 01:10:49.119
Peekaboo! Peekaboo!

01:10:49.870 --> 01:10:51.080
Goo, goo, goo.

01:10:52.206 --> 01:10:55.668
I cannot believe
two treasures came out at once.

01:10:55.751 --> 01:10:58.587
Peekaboo! Peekaboo! Goo, goo, goo.

01:10:58.671 --> 01:10:59.880
Peekaboo! Peekaboo!

01:10:59.964 --> 01:11:01.173
[both] Goo, goo, goo.

01:11:01.257 --> 01:11:04.385
What are Dan and Gang
doing here yet again?

01:11:04.969 --> 01:11:05.803
Oh, dear.

01:11:06.637 --> 01:11:07.596
Goodness.

01:11:08.514 --> 01:11:09.598
[chuckles]

01:11:09.682 --> 01:11:12.101
[Maid Kim] Are you Gang or are you Dan?

01:11:12.184 --> 01:11:15.312
He left them here to visit
his mother-in-law with his wife.

01:11:15.396 --> 01:11:17.606
They ask you to babysit
every chance they get.

01:11:18.482 --> 01:11:20.359
Only they get to have fun.

01:11:20.442 --> 01:11:21.360
What about us?

01:11:21.443 --> 01:11:22.861
We're newlyweds too.

01:11:23.570 --> 01:11:26.573
This is the reason why
we're never able to travel anywhere far.

01:11:27.157 --> 01:11:28.826
Just stop babysitting for those two.

01:11:28.909 --> 01:11:31.662
If you keep agreeing to it,
they'll keep asking!

01:11:31.745 --> 01:11:33.080
- [coos]
- It's not for long.

01:11:33.622 --> 01:11:36.500
How would you feel
if they were Uk's babies?

01:11:39.962 --> 01:11:42.673
- You wouldn't babysit them?
- Young Master Jang's babies?

01:11:43.382 --> 01:11:44.383
[chuckles]

01:11:44.466 --> 01:11:47.386
If they were his babies,
I'd definitely babysit them.

01:11:47.469 --> 01:11:49.847
Your young master Uk
still comes first, huh?

01:11:50.514 --> 01:11:52.725
He will forever
come first for you, Maid Kim.

01:11:52.808 --> 01:11:54.810
Hey, you! Don't be jealous.

01:11:54.893 --> 01:11:56.186
[chuckles]

01:11:56.854 --> 01:11:59.148
Goodness! What a relief!

01:11:59.231 --> 01:12:01.692
They're both handsome
because they take after Young Lady Jin.

01:12:01.775 --> 01:12:05.070
But they have long arms and legs
because they take after Dang-gu.

01:12:05.154 --> 01:12:08.741
I know the babies are cute
but don't always babysit them.

01:12:08.824 --> 01:12:09.783
Just sometimes.

01:12:10.784 --> 01:12:11.827
[retches]

01:12:12.411 --> 01:12:13.787
- Oh!
- What's wrong?

01:12:13.871 --> 01:12:16.415
Gosh, maybe it's the honey biscuits I had.
[retches]

01:12:18.667 --> 01:12:19.793
Ooh?

01:12:22.046 --> 01:12:25.174
- Ooh?
- Uh… can't be, it can't be that.

01:12:30.179 --> 01:12:31.013
[gasps]

01:12:32.348 --> 01:12:33.474
[gasps]

01:12:33.557 --> 01:12:35.309
[soft music playing]

01:12:35.392 --> 01:12:37.061
[laughs bashfully]

01:12:38.896 --> 01:12:40.856
Well, nothing's for sure yet.

01:12:43.859 --> 01:12:44.693
[Ho-gyeong laughs]

01:12:45.527 --> 01:12:47.363
I have high expectations for you.

01:12:48.280 --> 01:12:49.156
[Dang-gu chuckles]

01:12:49.239 --> 01:12:51.700
[Ho-gyeong] Next time,
be sure to have twin girls.

01:12:53.327 --> 01:12:54.328
Uh-uh…

01:12:54.411 --> 01:12:58.707
Then are you upset that
both of our children are just boys?

01:12:58.791 --> 01:13:01.126
I'm not upset. They are the Park family.

01:13:01.210 --> 01:13:04.296
I just want a daughter
who'll carry the Jin line.

01:13:04.380 --> 01:13:05.214
[Dang-gu exhales]

01:13:05.297 --> 01:13:09.760
But Uk told me not to ever dream of
having a daughter because he's having one.

01:13:09.843 --> 01:13:10.677
[chuckles]

01:13:11.804 --> 01:13:14.098
So those two are in North Fortress now?

01:13:14.181 --> 01:13:18.352
They said that they caught one,
and were heading to Seoho Fortress now.

01:13:18.435 --> 01:13:20.354
But I don't know when they'll return.

01:13:20.437 --> 01:13:23.190
They promised to return
to celebrate the twins' 100th day.

01:13:23.899 --> 01:13:24.733
Ah.

01:13:24.817 --> 01:13:28.612
Bu-yeon agreed to help out Jeongjingak,
so they should be returning soon.

01:13:28.695 --> 01:13:31.490
Bu-yeon agreed to help you out with this?

01:13:31.573 --> 01:13:34.284
Jeongjingak is, uh, planning
to recruit new mages,

01:13:34.368 --> 01:13:36.787
and she's going to help Yul
with the selection process.

01:13:36.870 --> 01:13:40.332
Jeongjingak mages are
being selected by applications?

01:13:40.416 --> 01:13:44.753
Seo Yul is now in charge of
what Master Seo Gyeong established.

01:13:44.837 --> 01:13:47.506
[Dang-gu] He made that decision
as the new leader of Jeongjingak.

01:13:47.589 --> 01:13:48.882
QUALIFICATIONS
ANYONE WITH PASSION AND DETERMINATION

01:13:50.384 --> 01:13:55.222
Ah. Is this really
how… you plan to recruit?

01:13:55.305 --> 01:13:57.349
[Heo Yeom]
Then all sorts of people will apply.

01:13:57.975 --> 01:14:00.894
All the children
of the mage families in the capital

01:14:00.978 --> 01:14:03.063
are excited to hear
Seo Yul is now in charge.

01:14:03.730 --> 01:14:06.733
However, if we recruit this way,
children from prestigious families

01:14:06.817 --> 01:14:09.027
will most likely not apply to Jeongjingak.

01:14:09.111 --> 01:14:11.613
When Master Seo Gyeong
first founded Jeongjingak,

01:14:12.197 --> 01:14:15.242
he did not intend for us only to train
children from prestigious families.

01:14:15.826 --> 01:14:19.163
But it's not like just
anyone is able to train casting spells.

01:14:19.246 --> 01:14:20.831
I'm not recruiting just anyone.

01:14:21.707 --> 01:14:24.293
I'll be picking only those
with good energy and potential.

01:14:24.376 --> 01:14:26.879
And those two were the ones
you picked first,

01:14:27.838 --> 01:14:28.922
based on those principles.

01:14:35.846 --> 01:14:39.224
They come to me, strongly recommended
by the most powerful priestess in Daeho.

01:14:39.308 --> 01:14:42.352
She even said with the proper training,

01:14:42.436 --> 01:14:45.147
Sun-i could be even more powerful than
her own husband, Jang Uk.

01:14:45.230 --> 01:14:47.149
More powerful than even Uk?

01:14:47.649 --> 01:14:49.026
[Seo Yul] They are my first pupils.

01:14:49.818 --> 01:14:53.238
I will train them hard
and make sure they outperform him.

01:14:53.322 --> 01:14:54.198
[Heo Yeom] Hmm.

01:15:00.329 --> 01:15:02.581
Seo Yul's obsession with being the best

01:15:02.664 --> 01:15:05.000
has always been very strong,
even when he trained here.

01:15:05.083 --> 01:15:09.838
Those two are going to have it very rough
thanks to their persistent master.

01:15:09.922 --> 01:15:13.300
Anyhow, what matters is that
Jin Bu-yeon vouched for them.

01:15:13.800 --> 01:15:15.427
So they must be special.

01:15:15.511 --> 01:15:19.681
From what I hear, she's also secretly
taking part in reviewing

01:15:19.765 --> 01:15:22.309
the potential Queen for His Majesty.

01:15:22.392 --> 01:15:23.227
Hmm?

01:15:25.521 --> 01:15:26.480
She is?

01:15:32.319 --> 01:15:33.195
Hmm…

01:15:34.363 --> 01:15:35.572
Master Heo.

01:15:35.656 --> 01:15:37.699
Why are you staring so hard
at Young Lady Heo?

01:15:37.783 --> 01:15:41.662
I'm wondering if my granddaughter
could one day be queen.

01:15:42.788 --> 01:15:43.622
The queen?

01:15:43.705 --> 01:15:47.167
[Heo Yeom] Back when I gave Jang Uk
my torrent of energy,

01:15:47.834 --> 01:15:51.880
he promised to grant me
a single wish for anything in return.

01:15:52.381 --> 01:15:54.007
Married couples are to be one,

01:15:54.716 --> 01:15:57.135
so if the wife gets to take part
in choosing the queen,

01:15:57.219 --> 01:15:59.930
I can just simply say
"Pick my granddaughter".

01:16:00.013 --> 01:16:00.847
[laughs]

01:16:01.431 --> 01:16:04.393
But Master Heo.
I think she's seeing someone right now.

01:16:05.352 --> 01:16:06.186
Seriously?

01:16:07.062 --> 01:16:07.896
But who?

01:16:07.980 --> 01:16:10.274
[doctor Seo] A young man
who came in with a broken arm.

01:16:10.357 --> 01:16:12.526
Since then,
he brings her flowers every time.

01:16:14.611 --> 01:16:15.654
Is that so?

01:16:15.737 --> 01:16:16.738
[giggles]

01:16:17.614 --> 01:16:19.449
- But wait, who is he?
- He's handsome.

01:16:19.533 --> 01:16:21.493
As handsome as Young Master Seo.

01:16:21.577 --> 01:16:23.453
Oh, really?
[laughs]

01:16:23.537 --> 01:16:26.331
I didn't know she was seeing someone.
[laughs]

01:16:26.915 --> 01:16:28.000
I'm so proud.

01:16:28.667 --> 01:16:32.129
So then instead of trying to get
my granddaughter picked to be queen,

01:16:32.212 --> 01:16:34.298
I'll ask her to examine him.

01:16:34.381 --> 01:16:36.508
Finding His Majesty's queen is urgent.

01:16:37.217 --> 01:16:39.428
He focuses on handling the court.

01:16:39.511 --> 01:16:41.263
And since Master Lee often visits,

01:16:42.180 --> 01:16:43.599
there are rumors

01:16:43.682 --> 01:16:46.852
that His Majesty has appointed
Master Lee as his master.

01:16:46.935 --> 01:16:47.811
[gasps]

01:16:48.645 --> 01:16:51.064
But then, that means…

01:16:51.148 --> 01:16:54.526
[Beom] They say that the King is
practicing chastity nowadays.

01:16:54.610 --> 01:16:56.403
But what about his successor?

01:16:56.486 --> 01:16:57.613
Did you not hear…

01:16:58.280 --> 01:17:00.073
that the king before last had a son?

01:17:00.157 --> 01:17:03.035
Ah, yeah,
I heard that it's Jang Uk, right?

01:17:03.118 --> 01:17:06.496
I knew there had to be a reason
why Jang Uk was so extraordinary.

01:17:06.580 --> 01:17:09.583
I knew it ever since
I saw him beat the Crown Prince.

01:17:09.666 --> 01:17:12.377
Even back then, he was already special.

01:17:12.461 --> 01:17:14.004
[Yeol] Should I also practice chastity?

01:17:14.087 --> 01:17:15.547
Goodness!
[tuts]

01:17:15.631 --> 01:17:17.132
These men are really just…

01:17:17.633 --> 01:17:22.054
His Majesty needs to get married very soon
so these chastity rumors can go away.

01:17:22.137 --> 01:17:24.640
Why would I, the King,
be practicing chastity?

01:17:26.725 --> 01:17:27.851
That's surely

01:17:28.477 --> 01:17:31.271
the most absurd thing I've heard
since that bogus shaman told me

01:17:31.355 --> 01:17:33.065
to adopt a turtle as my child.

01:17:34.358 --> 01:17:35.692
- I'm King.
- [Master Lee] Exactly.

01:17:35.776 --> 01:17:38.403
That's why you should
select a queen as soon as possible.

01:17:38.487 --> 01:17:39.821
I mean, Jin Bu-yeon promised

01:17:39.905 --> 01:17:43.325
to send royal notices
to the women she had already picked out.

01:17:43.408 --> 01:17:45.243
Just when are those two
planning on coming back?

01:17:45.327 --> 01:17:49.206
Both of them still look quite busy because
what they're doing is also important.

01:17:49.790 --> 01:17:52.292
So how many relics, did you say,
escaped when Jinyowon collapsed?

01:17:52.376 --> 01:17:53.960
A total of 31 escaped,

01:17:54.044 --> 01:17:56.254
and as of now, 12 have been captured.

01:17:56.338 --> 01:18:00.217
[Master Lee] Among those, there's a mouse
that goes around in human form,

01:18:00.300 --> 01:18:03.261
and even a mysterious flute
that lures only children.

01:18:03.345 --> 01:18:07.349
But the crock that spreads rumors,
and a crying frog that spreads

01:18:07.432 --> 01:18:09.976
all kinds of plagues
are the especially dangerous ones.

01:18:10.060 --> 01:18:12.354
They'll be pretty busy
trying to catch all of them.

01:18:19.236 --> 01:18:20.445
Well, I guess Jang Uk

01:18:20.529 --> 01:18:23.740
will try to use that as an excuse
to never become my Gwanju.

01:18:24.783 --> 01:18:27.202
The next time I see Jang Uk,
I'm going to urge him

01:18:27.786 --> 01:18:32.249
to be sure to drop by
because he's missed so much by you.

01:18:32.916 --> 01:18:33.834
[scoffs]

01:18:37.045 --> 01:18:38.672
This is Gwiseo's pottery.

01:18:39.297 --> 01:18:42.467
Tell them to catch the mouse
and just put it in here.

01:18:43.260 --> 01:18:44.094
All right then.

01:18:44.678 --> 01:18:47.222
Still, I'm very relieved that
not all of the relics

01:18:47.305 --> 01:18:48.598
managed to escape, thanks to you.

01:18:49.391 --> 01:18:51.560
If the mosquitoes
that cause earthquakes had escaped,

01:18:51.643 --> 01:18:53.061
it would have been very bad.

01:18:53.145 --> 01:18:55.939
I also stayed alive because of that girl.

01:18:57.274 --> 01:18:58.108
Does it…

01:18:59.234 --> 01:19:01.361
no longer bother you
when you see her face?

01:19:02.612 --> 01:19:04.156
If, as you said before,

01:19:04.239 --> 01:19:08.827
it was really Jin Seol-ran's soul
that was born in Bu-yeon's body,

01:19:08.910 --> 01:19:12.831
and she chose Naksu to keep her body
as she left this world behind…

01:19:14.291 --> 01:19:18.712
Well, then I believe that
Bu-yeon lives, all thanks to that girl.

01:19:23.550 --> 01:19:25.886
This mouse eats
the clippings that are trimmed

01:19:25.969 --> 01:19:29.806
in the middle of the night
and takes the appearance of that person.

01:19:29.890 --> 01:19:30.891
[inhales sharply]

01:19:30.974 --> 01:19:35.061
It transforms itself to look like you,
then goes to your home

01:19:35.979 --> 01:19:38.315
and eats your whole family alive!

01:19:38.398 --> 01:19:39.399
[kids scream]

01:19:39.483 --> 01:19:41.485
[whimsical music playing]

01:19:42.819 --> 01:19:43.653
So then…

01:19:44.946 --> 01:19:46.823
always be very careful of where

01:19:47.365 --> 01:19:49.743
you end up throwing away
your nail clippings.

01:19:49.826 --> 01:19:52.746
[little girl sobs]

01:19:52.829 --> 01:19:56.082
If you are scared,
just go to the big tree and then pray.

01:19:56.833 --> 01:19:58.960
[boy] I know about this really big tree.

01:19:59.503 --> 01:20:03.632
You can see two people appear at the top,
but only whenever there is a full moon.

01:20:03.715 --> 01:20:07.719
They saved my big sister
when she was being chased by a tiger.

01:20:08.303 --> 01:20:11.431
They also summoned fireflies
and lit up the dark path for her.

01:20:12.015 --> 01:20:14.017
- Are you serious?
- Is that true?

01:20:14.100 --> 01:20:17.229
Do they… show up there very often?

01:20:17.312 --> 01:20:20.607
Yeah, I heard it's a very tall man
and a pretty lady.

01:20:20.690 --> 01:20:23.318
They're actually married.

01:20:23.401 --> 01:20:27.155
They're the ones who brought
the light and the shadow.

01:20:27.239 --> 01:20:29.950
Both of which serve
to protect the entire world.

01:20:38.083 --> 01:20:38.959
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:20:39.709 --> 01:20:40.794
[Jang Uk] Darling.

01:20:40.877 --> 01:20:43.922
Until when are you gonna
make me carry you up here?

01:20:44.005 --> 01:20:45.006
For eternity.

01:20:46.091 --> 01:20:47.801
- For eternity?
- Yeah. You promised.

01:20:48.385 --> 01:20:49.219
Hmm.

01:20:50.053 --> 01:20:52.681
What's wrong?
Are you fed up already, dear husband?

01:20:52.764 --> 01:20:54.641
- No, no!
- Forget it. I'm going down.

01:20:54.724 --> 01:20:55.892
No, wait.

01:20:58.436 --> 01:21:00.605
It's not that I'm fed up.

01:21:01.523 --> 01:21:03.316
You were once a mage who mastered Chisu.

01:21:03.400 --> 01:21:06.528
So I just think you should
challenge yourself. Yeah, that's all!

01:21:06.611 --> 01:21:08.947
Is that so? I possess great divine powers.

01:21:09.823 --> 01:21:11.116
I don't need to train anymore.

01:21:12.033 --> 01:21:14.452
No way. Never. It makes me sick.

01:21:14.536 --> 01:21:16.872
Wow! Now, I wonder which master it was

01:21:16.955 --> 01:21:18.957
that would always scold me
for being too lazy?

01:21:19.040 --> 01:21:21.543
But you came this far
because you have a great master.

01:21:21.626 --> 01:21:23.712
- Mm, what?
- From now on, be grateful

01:21:23.795 --> 01:21:24.629
and treat her well.

01:21:25.422 --> 01:21:26.256
Yeah.

01:21:27.215 --> 01:21:30.010
Of course! So, did you find
the one you were looking for?

01:21:30.677 --> 01:21:32.220
- Over there?
- I did.

01:21:32.888 --> 01:21:33.722
I saw it.

01:21:35.849 --> 01:21:37.309
It's to the west.

01:21:37.392 --> 01:21:39.394
[suspenseful music playing]

01:21:44.816 --> 01:21:47.360
[Bu-yeon] It's a cat. A wily beast
that escaped from Jinyowon.

01:21:47.861 --> 01:21:48.737
A cat?

01:21:51.364 --> 01:21:52.741
[relic growling]

01:21:54.576 --> 01:21:57.537
Hey, you said… it was a cat?

01:21:58.288 --> 01:22:01.416
That growl sounds like
it's bigger than a tiger.

01:22:02.250 --> 01:22:04.753
It's big… like an elephant.

01:22:04.836 --> 01:22:06.004
I bet that cat…

01:22:07.088 --> 01:22:08.673
is extremely cute.

01:22:09.257 --> 01:22:10.216
[relic growling]

01:22:11.009 --> 01:22:13.011
[suspenseful music playing]

01:22:19.559 --> 01:22:20.727
Stay right by my side.

01:22:29.152 --> 01:22:29.986
Here it comes.

01:22:31.738 --> 01:22:32.948
Get rid of it.

01:22:33.031 --> 01:22:34.741
[relic growling]

01:22:45.752 --> 01:22:48.046
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]
